<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thus our treasures safe investing</l><l>In His care,</l><l>Kept in His pavilion resting,</l><l>May we dare</l><l>Still to trust, thru faith’s deep testing,</l><l>Sure, God will His ways declare.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
